Rem Recorded from the C++ build: the original stops on a forgotten "illegal" instruction
Mask Iff 255 : Iff Anim "AMOSPRO:Tutorial/Iff_Anim/AMOS.Anim" To 0,2
Print #1,Screen Width;Screen Height;Screen Colour;Frame Param
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/iffanim_1.iff"
Iff Anim "AMOSPRO:Tutorial/Iff_Anim/AMOS.Anim" To 1,-1
Iff Anim "AMOSPRO:Examples/Iff/Logo.iff" To 1
Print #1,"end"
